    {
      "displayText": "Eh non, raté !\nIl y en a neuf !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500680020006E006F006E002C002000720061007400E900200021000A0049006C0020007900200065006E002000610020006E0065007500660020002100100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bonne réponse !\nIl y en a bien neuf !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006F006E006E00650020007200E90070006F006E0073006500200021000A0049006C0020007900200065006E002000610020006200690065006E0020006E0065007500660020002100100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "D’ailleurs, savais-tu que le Centre Pokémon\nde l’Avenue Ventôse est celui où l’on vend<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nle moins de Poké Balls ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 119
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourtant, avec l’aide d’un certain Pokémon,\non pourrait inverser cette tendance.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJ’ai donc décidé de mener une petite opération\ncommerciale, et je lui ai trouvé le nom parfait...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 186
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’opération « Un Trompignon pour du pognon » !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C2019006F007000E90072006100740069006F006E002000AB00200055006E002000540072006F006D007000690067006E006F006E00200070006F0075007200200064007500200070006F0067006E006F006E002000BB0020002100100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Laisse-moi t’en dire un peu plus sur le concept.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00610069007300730065002D006D006F00690020007420190065006E0020006400690072006500200075006E002000700065007500200070006C0075007300200073007500720020006C006500200063006F006E0063006500700074002E00100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu vois le comptoir ? Ne trouves-tu pas\nqu’il manque un peu de décoration ?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nL’ambiance est morose. C’est la déprime !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 125
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais je suis sûre que si on y met un <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Trompignon<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>,\nça va changer la donne !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nQuand les gens verront sa bouille de Poké Ball,\nça leur donnera envie d’en acheter, c’est certain !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 189
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Apporte-moi un Trompignon ! Je t’en prie !\nLe succès de l’opération repose sur tes épaules.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors, tu m’as apporté un Trompignon ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F00720073002C0020007400750020006D2019006100730020006100700070006F0072007400E900200075006E002000540072006F006D007000690067006E006F006E0020003F00100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le voici ! Un Trompignon pour du pognon !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500200076006F0069006300690020002100200055006E002000540072006F006D007000690067006E006F006E00200070006F0075007200200064007500200070006F0067006E006F006E002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas encore.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200065006E0063006F00720065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, je t’en supplie !\nApporte-moi un Trompignon !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C0020006A00650020007420190065006E00200073007500700070006C0069006500200021000A004100700070006F007200740065002D006D006F006900200075006E002000540072006F006D007000690067006E006F006E0020002100100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00650072006300690020002100100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mes yeux me trompent-ils ?\nUn Trompignon Baron ?! Quelle générosité !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00650073002000790065007500780020006D0065002000740072006F006D00700065006E0074002D0069006C00730020003F000A0055006E002000540072006F006D007000690067006E006F006E0020004200610072006F006E0020003F00210020005100750065006C006C00650020006700E9006E00E90072006F00730069007400E90020002100100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mes yeux me trompent-ils ?\nUn Trompignon chromatique ?! Quelle générosité !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il ressemble parfaitement à une Poké Ball !\nL’opération se déroule comme prévu !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous allons forcément atteindre nos objectifs\nde vente de Poké Balls, grâce à lui !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Trompignon !\nOn va faire une bonne équipe, toi et moi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540072006F006D007000690067006E006F006E00200021000A004F006E00200076006100200066006100690072006500200075006E006500200062006F006E006E0065002000E900710075006900700065002C00200074006F00690020006500740020006D006F00690020002100100002011401C60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pignon ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
